<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-miranda-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila miranda detail-scale Turing wavelength (1.9 µm, 0 Ma) — Model fidelity to source: 91/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Schnakenberg kinetics, diffusion-free stability, and the Turing margin are implemented and checked by six Lean theorems with no sorry. The explicit-Euler Fourier symbol matches continuum σ(k) with Pearson r = 0.999999996. Parameters are reconstructed for 1.864 µm; they are not a published miranda table." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-miranda-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-miranda-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-miranda-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.1e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-miranda-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila miranda detail-scale Turing wavelength (1.9 µm, 0 Ma) — Morphometric validation: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Dispersion Pearson r = 0.999999996 and RMSE = 1.65e-5 per time. Equal-diffusion std ratio is 4.9e-5 against a null of 1. Plate foreground 0.370, coherency 0.806, and circularity 0.054 differ from their priors. Orientation KS between plate and pure field is 0.333. Chronoseries model wavelengths sit on 1.412 and 2.286 µm, not on the priors 1.55 and 2.05." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
